msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The seller already received the fiat and the escrow is settled: the sats belong to the buyer, but the Lightning payment to their invoice does not arrive. The order stays like this until the buyer submits an invoice that can be paid; each attempt lasts at most %(timeout)s s."
msgstr "売り手はすでに法定通貨を受け取り、エスクローは決済済みです：sats は買い手のものですが、そのインボイスへのLightning支払いが届きません。買い手が支払い可能なインボイスを送るまでオーダーはこのままです。各試行は最大 %(timeout)s 秒です。"

